---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Return & Refund Policy | Great Gus Productions"
  description="Return and refund policy for merchandise purchased from Great Gus Productions.">
  
  <section class="legal-page">
    <h1>Return & Refund Policy</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: March 9, 2026</p>

    <div class="legal-content">

      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>
        Merchandise sold through Great Gus Productions LLC is produced on demand and
        fulfilled by our production partner, Printful. Because each item is made
        specifically after an order is placed, we generally do not accept returns
        or exchanges for reasons such as incorrect sizing, change of mind, or
        buyer’s remorse.
      </p>

      <h2>Damaged, Defective, or Incorrect Items</h2>
      <p>
        If your order arrives damaged, defective, or incorrect, please contact us
        within <strong>7 days of delivery</strong>. Include your order number and
        clear photos of the issue so we can review the problem and arrange a
        replacement or refund if appropriate.
      </p>

      <p>
        Once the issue is verified, we will work with our fulfillment partner to
        provide a replacement item or refund where applicable.
      </p>

      <h2>Lost Packages</h2>
      <p>
        If your package appears to be lost in transit, please contact us and we
        will help investigate the shipment with the carrier. Replacement or
        refund eligibility will be evaluated on a case-by-case basis.
      </p>

      <h2>Refund Processing</h2>
      <p>
        Approved refunds are processed through our payment processor, Stripe,
        and will be issued back to the original payment method used at checkout.
        Depending on your bank or card provider, it may take several business
        days for the refund to appear on your statement.
      </p>

      <h2>Shipping Costs</h2>
      <p>
        Shipping charges are non-refundable unless the item arrives damaged,
        defective, or incorrect.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For any return or refund inquiries, please contact:
      </p>

      <p>
        GREAT GUS PRODUCTIONS LLC<br />
        Washington State<br />
        <a href="mailto:greatgusproductions@gmail.com">
          greatgusproductions@gmail.com
        </a>
      </p>

      <h2>Policy Updates</h2>
      <p>
        This Return & Refund Policy may be updated from time to time without
        prior notice. The latest version will always be available on this page.
      </p>

      <h2>Copyright</h2>
      <p>
        © 2018–2026 GREAT GUS PRODUCTIONS LLC. All Rights Reserved.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 1rem 6rem;
  }

  .legal-page h1 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .last-updated {
    margin-top: -2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    text-align: left;
    color: #bdbdbd;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .legal-content p,
  .legal-content li {
    color: #e6e6e6;
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .legal-content ul {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
  }
</style>